# The LMRS exactly as upstream's factory builds it: no setting and no driver parameter changed.
#
# The benchmark default is the configuration final-v2 (LmrsDefaults.FINAL_V2): the composition of upstream's
# ShortMerge demo with the driver parameters of the MiRoVA campaign final_v2. This preset goes back to upstream.
# The car desired-speed distribution is a property of the scenario and stays as the facility sets it.
# Select with --preset=upstream (MIROVA_PRESET=upstream on the cluster).
lmrs.defaults=upstream
